## 1. Executive Summary

The MedSync Health Strategic Plan for 2025-2027 outlines our commitment to transitioning from high-growth, venture-backed scale-up to a sustainably profitable, market-leading healthcare technology platform. While FY 2024 saw significant revenue growth to **AED 485,100,000**, the company operated at a net loss of **-AED 22,491,000** [1]. This three-year plan is centered on three core strategic objectives: achieving sustainable profitability, accelerating high-value customer acquisition, and solidifying our position as a best-in-class platform for patient care and compliance.

This document serves as the foundation for all subsequent departmental OKRs (e.g., STRAT-005: Engineering OKRs) and financial planning (e.g., FIN-001: Financial Targets).

